Package: landisR.fire
Type: Package
Title: Modular Fire Models for landisR
Version: 0.1.0.9007
Authors@R: person('Yan', 'Boulanger', role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Provides an external, modular fire-model framework designed to
    interact with landisR without becoming part of the landisR succession
    engine. Fire ignition, target size, cell-to-cell spread, conditional burn
    probability, severity and mortality are explicit replaceable components.
    Components may prepare reusable numeric caches before simulation so flexible
    scientific models do not require repeated expensive data extraction inside
    fire-spread loops. The first reference implementation reproduces LANDIS-II
    Base Fire through an internal compatibility layer before extended
    alternatives are developed.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
